                                                "sense_id": "d56aeedf-13ec-37d6-9f52-ea0c3b1fa017",
                                                "text": "The debate here is not over whether raising £26,000 (and counting) for our troops is a wonderful thing – it unarguably is – but over whether, whenever times are tough and money must be found, our default reaction as women should be to take off our knickers to help out?"
                                            }
                                        ]
